# Velani

> Velani is a software company operated by VELANI LLC. It makes NEVORA, an app for scheduling, time clock and payroll calculation for teams that work in shifts; Rondo, the assistant inside NEVORA for the business Owner; and NEVORA Relay, which is in design. The site is in English and Spanish.

Velani does not sell physical products on this site, and nothing here can be bought in a cart. Velani does not take on new custom websites or apps. To start, a business asks for a free NEVORA trial on the Contact page (online signup isn't open yet, so Velani sets up the workplace with them).

## NEVORA

- [NEVORA Workforce](https://www.thevelani.com/pages/nevora): build and publish the week's schedule, shift swaps and time off answered in the app, a time clock on a shared tablet with a four-digit PIN, timecards ready for review, and payroll calculated from approved hours with pay statements. Runs on the web, in English and Spanish.
- [Plans](https://www.thevelani.com/pages/plans): free for 30 days with no card, counted from the day the workplace is created in NEVORA. After the trial, each business pays $19 a month for 1 to 15 employees or $29 a month for 16 to 30, for the whole app; owners are not counted. More than 30 employees: assisted setup by request (support@thevelani.com, reply within two business days); teams that qualify get the same 30-day trial.
- NEVORA calculates pay statements. It does not pay employees or file payroll taxes.
- Each workplace has its own NEVORA address. Owners, managers and employees sign in there with their Employee ID and password; the four-digit PIN is only for the shared tablet time clock.
- Employees get their NEVORA account from their workplace, not from this website. [NEVORA support](https://www.thevelani.com/pages/nevora-support)

## Rondo

- [Rondo](https://www.thevelani.com/pages/rondo): the assistant inside NEVORA for the business Owner, included in NEVORA. The Owner asks in plain words, in English or Spanish, about today's team, coverage and recorded hours; Rondo answers from the workplace's own records, names the source, and can prepare a coverage change. Nothing changes until the Owner approves, and NEVORA checks each change again before it applies. Managers and employees use NEVORA without it.
- The chat adviser on thevelani.com is a separate thing: it answers questions about Velani and its products, can be wrong, and cannot make bookings, changes or payments.

## NEVORA Relay

- [Relay](https://www.thevelani.com/pages/relay): orders, the kitchen screen and inventory in one system, for cafés, restaurants and counters. In design, with no release date or price yet. People can [join the waitlist](https://www.thevelani.com/pages/contact?interest=relay).

